        "created_at": "2015-06-29T19:05:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Note that HP goes into the negatives, so if there's a target with 1 hp, and you deal 3 damage to it, and then heal it 1, it will be at -1 and it will die once Fixed Point leaves. &nbsp;If you had only dealt 1 damage to it, it would have healed back to 1 hp and wouldn't die.</p>",
