        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluedarky/{size}/1975_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-06-29T19:36:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"VisforYoshi\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/visforyoshi/48/2185_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> VisforYoshi:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Wait, Fixed point preents returning to the hand too? I thought it only affected if cards would be destroyed</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>The exact wording of the Indestructable term is that it prevents the card from leaving the game in any way, shape or form. &nbsp;Once an indestructable card is in play, it's stays in play until it's no longer indestructable.</p>",
